{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-3059194","kind":"blog","title":"【创作】2016年下北泽拍摄","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-04-28","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 撮影","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[{"name":"宝可梦 红·绿","slug":"red-green"}],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-3059194/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"记录《宝可梦 红·绿 超级音乐合集》长篇采访的取景拍摄，重访下北泽，回到宝可梦诞生的地方。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","音楽","ポケモン"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 撮影","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3059194.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160501224125id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/3059194.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">2月9日 上午9:45</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">下北泽</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">《宝可梦 红·绿 超级音乐合集》\n\n\n长篇采访用的\n照片拍摄\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/001-0f1a5aa4a8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/001-0f1a5aa4a8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n在从那时起就已经存在的\nDisk Union 门前\n拍摄\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/002-f3f797bc1a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/002-f3f797bc1a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n        （5楼曾经是 GAME FREAK！）\n    \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n在可以说是\nGAME FREAK 员工食堂的\n珉亭（珉亭）\n附近拍摄\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/003-0b4a62ec67.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/003-0b4a62ec67.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n总觉得特别\n怀念啊（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下北泽\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n宝可梦 红·绿\n就是在这里\n诞生的\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n在这样充满回忆的地方\n拍摄的\n内页照片\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n拍摄是在2月，\n\n不过因为发售是在4月，\n\n所以虽然很冷，\n\n还是一会儿穿上外套，\n\n一会儿又脱下来（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n如果大家也能从照片中\n看见并感受到\n那种氛围，我会很开心！\n\n<br>\n\n \n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">2月9日 9:45 AM</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">下北沢</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">『ポケモン 赤・緑\n\nスーパーミュージック・コレクション』\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nロングインタビュー用の\n写真撮影\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/001-0f1a5aa4a8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/001-0f1a5aa4a8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n当時からあった\nDisk Union さんの前で\n撮影したり\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/002-f3f797bc1a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/002-f3f797bc1a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n        （5階がゲームフリークだった！）\n    \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nゲームフリークスタッフの\n食堂とも言える\n珉亭（みんてい）\nの近くで撮影したり\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/003-0b4a62ec67.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3059194/003-0b4a62ec67.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"636\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n何だかとっても\n懐かしい（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下北沢\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nここで\nポケットモンスター 赤・緑は\n生まれました\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそんな思い出の場所で\n撮影した\nブックレットの写真\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n撮影は2月なのですが\n\n発売は4月ということだったので\n\n寒いけど\n\nコートを着たり脱いだり（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n写真から\nそんな空気感も\n見て感じてもらえると嬉しいです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n \n\n<br>\n\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}